OL,3,GNEWSA'Bleak' space outside historic
OL,4,Alandmark to be revamped
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Bleak" space outside a town's
OL,7,F"important historic landmark" is to be
OL,8,Frevamped.
OL,10,FThe 500-year-old Yelde Hall, in
OL,11,FChippenham, Wiltshire, attracts scores
OL,12,Fof tourists each year, but the area
OL,13,Fsurrounding the Grade I listed building
OL,14,Fhas fallen into a poor state.
OL,16,FAbout #50,000 has now been secured by
OL,17,Fthe town council, which owns the
OL,18,Fbuilding, to install new seating,
OL,19,Fplanters and bin storage. Work is
OL,20,Fexpected to begin within the next three
OL,21,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
