OL,3,GNEWSA'Bleak' space outside historic
OL,4,Alandmark to be revamped
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a planning document, officials said
OL,7,Fthe space outside the medieval hall has
OL,8,Fturned "bleak", with outdated planters
OL,9,Fand cluttered bins. They added the work
OL,10,Fwould help to showcase one of the
OL,11,Ftown's most important historic
OL,12,Flandmarks.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
